WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:05.137
-Anyone out here watching this
new show, "House of Dragons"?

00:00:05.137 --> 00:00:07.673
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:07.673 --> 00:00:09.342
I am the biggest
"Game of Thrones" fan.

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.844
I love their new show
and I got to tell you,

00:00:11.844 --> 00:00:13.512
I love that they're including
Black characters,

00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:16.916
but, to be honest,
the Black characters, um,

00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:19.652
they take me out of it
a little bit with the --

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:22.488
it's that blonde hair
and the old-time accents.

00:00:22.488 --> 00:00:23.656
It's a little jarring.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.090
You're like,
"Where are these people from?"

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:25.992
You know what I mean?

00:00:25.992 --> 00:00:28.027
And then they're coming out

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:29.795
with Season 2, I guess, soon

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:32.965
and, somehow, Lorne Michaels
arranged a sneak peek

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:35.034
of Season 2
of "House of Dragons."

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:37.336
Exclusive, so, check it out.

00:00:37.336 --> 00:00:39.405
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:42.442
[ "House of the Dragon"
theme song plays ]

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.279
-Before we go to war
with Kings Landing,

00:00:46.279 --> 00:00:48.548
we must know
who our true allies are.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:50.950
-These represent all of our
possible alliances, Your Grace.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:51.917
-Thank you, Daemon.

00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:53.219
-And I've prepared
this family tree

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:54.887
so we know who the hell
everyone is.

00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:58.458
-Yes, because our names are
insane and sound identical.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:00.960
-I've also prepared a chart
of who's having sex with whom

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:03.163
and, weirdly enough, it's the
same as the family tree.

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:05.365
-You have a visitor, Your Grace.

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:07.333
[ Door opens ]
Lord of the Tides,

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:11.571
the Sea Snake himself,
Corlys Velaryon.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.940
-Lord Corlys, this is
a most welcome surprise.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.075
Where have you come from?

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:17.176
-The Matrix.

00:01:17.176 --> 00:01:18.277
Just kidding.

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.245
-You must've been at sea
a long time, then.

00:01:20.245 --> 00:01:21.647
-Oh, of course.

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:25.185
This is where my people are
most comfortable, the ocean.

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:27.586
Yeah, we especially love
being on ships!

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:29.889
Never have any concerns
with ships

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:32.791
or what might happen to us
on ships.

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:33.926
-Have you come alone?

00:01:33.926 --> 00:01:35.528
-Oh, no, no, I brought
my granddaughters,

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:36.763
Baela and Rhaena.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.398
-Greetings, Your Grace.

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:40.933
-So happy to have traveled
40 days by ship

00:01:40.933 --> 00:01:42.668
in this ball gown,
Your Grace.

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:44.804
-It's wonderful to see you
since you are betrothed

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:48.741
to my nephew/stepsons
Jace and Luke.

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:51.711
-Yes, I look at
my future husband, and I think,

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:54.547
he is definitely going to
satisfy me sexually.

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:56.315
-Mm-hmm.
-And to what do we owe

00:01:56.315 --> 00:01:57.783
the honor of your visit,
Lord Corlys?

00:01:57.783 --> 00:02:00.152
-Yeah, well, you know, I know
that you in need of allies

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:01.654
now that your father has died.

00:02:01.654 --> 00:02:03.956
-Died? [ Groans ]

00:02:03.956 --> 00:02:05.090
-Oh, my God, man.

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:06.492
What is happening
with your face?

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:08.694
-The doctor says it's nothing.

00:02:08.694 --> 00:02:10.062
Just a little cough

00:02:10.062 --> 00:02:13.165
and my skin melted
and my eye fell out.

00:02:13.165 --> 00:02:15.602
-Well, I found you
some new allies

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:17.436
from even further-away lands

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:20.473
that have come to pay their
respects to the true queen.

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:24.577
-Well, well, well.

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.947
Good to see you, Your Grace.

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:30.916
Cousin Daemon, well, I haven't
seen you in a long time.

00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:34.120
How does it feel
to have sex with your niece?

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.989
Yuck.
-This whole family looks like

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.357
the sun took a look and said,
"No, thank you."

00:02:38.357 --> 00:02:40.693
[ Laughs ]
-Your Majesty,

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:43.663
looks like you got a case
of the monkey pox.

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:46.866
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:49.035
-You're going to die any minute,
ain't you?

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:50.503
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:54.140
-Well, if it isn't our cousin,
light-skinned Larry Targaryen.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:57.243
-[ Chuckles ]
Silky, your hoes are so old

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.945
their titties
give powdered milk.

00:02:58.945 --> 00:03:02.181
-You look like E.T. when they
dressed him up for Halloween.

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:05.117
-Ha.
-Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey,

00:03:05.117 --> 00:03:06.886
all that was hateful, man.

00:03:06.886 --> 00:03:09.321
-Your Jheri curls
are getting a little dry.

00:03:09.321 --> 00:03:12.158
-That's that dragon spray.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:14.427
-More visitors approach.

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.498
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:20.767
-Pardon me, Your Grace,

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.202
but I think your penis
just fell off.

00:03:23.602 --> 00:03:25.238
If you don't want it anymore,
can I keep it?

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:26.371
Might be able
to get some money for that.

00:03:26.371 --> 00:03:28.407
-Who is this foul man?

00:03:28.407 --> 00:03:30.042
-I came here
for some dragon rocks.

00:03:30.042 --> 00:03:31.277
I'm down to my last one.

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:33.379
-What the hell
is going on here?

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.381
-You mind if I, um,
get a light?

00:03:35.381 --> 00:03:36.783
Dracarys.

00:03:40.552 --> 00:03:42.221
-Be gone, all of you.

00:03:42.221 --> 00:03:43.722
-Oh, no, there's more.

00:03:43.722 --> 00:03:46.092
-I'm one of the baddest mother
[bleep] Westeros has ever seen.

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:48.227
One of the best singers and
one of the best dancers, too.

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:51.230
I'm Aegon Targaryen, bitch,
rider of dragons.

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.898
I heard you like
to ride lizards.

00:03:52.898 --> 00:03:54.734
Want to ride mine,
Your freaking Majesty?

00:03:56.535 --> 00:03:57.837
-[ Roars ]

00:03:57.837 --> 00:04:00.940
-Take me to Flea Bottom
so I can check on my hoes.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:02.808
-What up, Tar?

00:04:02.808 --> 00:04:04.443
I got a dragon now.

00:04:04.443 --> 00:04:06.445
-[Bleep] No, dragon.

00:04:06.512 --> 00:04:08.180
[Bleep] No, dragon.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:10.282
[ Siren chirps ]
-Good God, it's the police.

00:04:10.282 --> 00:04:12.384
What are they doing
all the way up here?

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:14.720
No matter how high I fly,

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:16.723
they always find you,
don't they?

